<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Rubén Blades</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1948">1948</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Rubén Blades is a Panamanian singer, songwriter, actor and politician, one of the leading figures of salsa music. His recordings of the 1970s with Willie Colón, notably the album Siembra of 1978, brought socially conscious lyrics to the genre. He ran for the presidency of Panama in 1994 and served as minister of tourism from 2004 to 2009.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ruben-blades.jpg" alt="Rubén Blades" width="320" height="426" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Gage Skidmore from Peoria, AZ, United States of America · CC BY-SA 2.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ruben_Blades_(48403756251)_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
